;  Stack frame (0x800 bytes):
;    sp+0x000 original termios   sp+0x050 key buffer   sp+0x060 timeval
;    sp+0x0b0 raw termios        sp+0x100 grid 16x16   sp+0x200 body queue
;    sp+0x300 frame buffer
;  Registers: w19 rng, w20/w23 last moved dx/dy, w21 queue head index,
;    w22 queue tail index, w24/w25 head x/y, w26/w27 dx/dy, w28 score
;  Grid cells: 0 empty, 1 snake, 2 food
